Step 1: Project Root Me Jao
text
C:\Users\HP\ai-enterprise-negotiator
Step 2: .gitignore File Check Karo
PowerShell me:

powershell
cd C:\Users\HP\ai-enterprise-negotiator
Get-ChildItem -Force -Filter ".gitignore"
Agar nahi mila → banao:

powershell
New-Item -ItemType File -Force -Path ".gitignore"
Step 3: VS Code Me Khol
text
